  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "feat(model): introduce zero-allocation DbModel for ADO.NET databases\n\n      - Add pooled DbModel class implementing high-performance TSV-like output streaming\n      - Support zero-alloc formatting for primitives, text escaping, Base64, and temporal types\n      - Implement SequentialAccess DbDataReader streaming directly into Lucifer Buffer\n      - Add GetCell(row, col) for fast, zero-allocation ReadOnlySpan<byte> cell querying\n      - Include transaction support (BeginTransaction, Commit, Rollback) with automatic reset\n      - Benchmark shows ~23% faster execution and lower memory allocation compared to traditional ADO.NET DTO mapping",
